  "objective": "weighted_BCE + .1*(paired_CTC_NLL_per_token + mean_ambient_blank_NLL_per_frame + positive_gain*mean_eligible_ordinary_positive_CTC_NLL_per_token). Both arms keep paired gain .1 and background gain 1; only new positive gain differs: 0 versus 1. Ordinary compact target [hey=1,nyx=2] represents synthesis intent, not continuation transcription. Empty eligible cohorts contribute zero. Explicit gain zero does not add a zero tensor to the parent loss graph.",
  "warmup_policy": "Exactly replay parent compact-CTC1000-step warmup. Both arms have the same cached frozen encoder states, head weights, schedule and unchanged binary weights/optimizer before joint training.",
